{"sourceUrl":"https://jidian.cug.edu.cn/info/2111/36391.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:59.774941+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://jidian.cug.edu.cn/info/2111/36391.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div><p><strong><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>机械与电子信息学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>年第</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>十二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>届研招校园开放日活动方案</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）机械与电子信息学院（简称</span><span>“机电学院”）有机械工程系、电子信息工程系、通信工程系和机器人工程系。机械设计制造及其自动化、电子信息工程为国家级一流专业，通信工程为湖北省一流专业。</span></span><span><span>学院现有教职工</span>111<span>人，其中博士生导师</span><span>32</span><span>人、教授</span><span>31</span><span>人、副教授</span><span>49</span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>有</span></span><span><span>国家人才计划</span>4<span>人、湖北省人才计划</span><span>14</span><span>人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>70</span><span>余年来，学院秉持“为党育人，为国育才”使命，与制造业发展同频共振，围绕国家战略需求提供人才培养支持，攻关行业技术难题，为企业提供智力支撑。当前，响应国家“新质生产力”战略，契合学校“双一流”建设目标，聚焦“机电通一体 </span><span>+ </span><span>智能系统”，将智能制造和智能体赋能地学领域，打造地学领域智能系统工程与装备教学和科研高地，服务国家战略需求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院有在校博士生、硕士生、本科生</span><span>2600</span><span>余名。紧扣国家“新质生产力”需求，构建“强基赋能・产教融合”人才培养体系，培养机电领域领军者。以“新工科”理念为引领，通过三维协同培养模式打造复合型工程领军人才。近五年，学院学子在各类学科竞赛中屡创佳绩，获国家级</span><span>/</span><span>省部级奖励约</span><span>400</span><span>余项，主持创新创业训练项目约</span><span>300</span><span>余项，升学率达</span><span>40%</span><span>，就业率达</span><span>95%</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院有两个二级学科博士学位点、三个学术型硕士学位点、两个一级学科专业硕士点，依托</span><span>1</span><span>个国家级科研平台、</span><span>5</span><span>个省部级基地及</span><span>5</span><span>个产业创新中心，形成“智能装备</span><span>+</span><span>电子信息”科研育人生态。聚焦三大领域，在多个方向取得突破，研制岩心自动化传输系统，近五年获省部级科技奖励</span><span>6</span><span>项，发表</span><span>SCI</span><span>论文</span><span>470</span><span>余篇，授权发明专利</span><span>360</span><span>余项。</span></span><span><span>现将我院</span>2026<span>年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案通知如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>对象及条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>凡有意报考我院硕士（</span><span>0811Z2</span><span>低空技术与工程、</span><span>0802</span><span>机械工程、</span><span>0810</span><span>信息与通信工程、</span><span>0855</span><span>机械、</span><span>0854</span><span>电子信息）、博士（</span><span>0818Z4</span><span>地质装备工程、</span><span>081100</span><span>控制科学与工程、</span><span>083203TK</span><span>低空技术与工程）学位研究生的各类考生均可申请</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、</span></span><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>及工作</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>学生报名：</span></span><strong><span>6<span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>—6</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日（每日</span><span>8:00-17:00</span><span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>。报名学生通过学校</span><span>“</span><span>研招校园开放日报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报申请。</span></span><span><br/></span><span>    </span><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx</span></a><span><br/></span><span>    </span><span><span>注意：</span></span><strong><span><span>未填写</span><span>“</span><span>申请院系</span><span>”</span><span>信息的，视为报名不成功</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span> </span><span><span>校园开放日活动时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>招生单位审核后，将于</span></span><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>前邮件通知符合条件的学生参加活动。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>具体</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>活动</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日程</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>采用线上线下相结合的方式。外校学生采用线上形式，本校学生采用线下形式。</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>日期</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地点</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>腾讯会议</span></span><span><span>号）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动内容</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9:00-10:</span></span><span><span>0</span></span><span><span>0</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>教二楼303</span></p><p><span>宣讲会议号:</span><span>（</span><span>485-647-279</span><span>）</span></p><p><span><span>351-715-722</span><span>（备用1）</span></span></p><p><span><span>951-466-425</span><span>（备用2）</span></span></p><p><span>互动会议号：</span></p><p><span>791-306-263（电子、通信专业）</span></p><p><span><span>485-647-279</span><span>（机械专业）</span></span></p><p><span>351-715-722（机械专业备用群号）</span></p><p><span><br/></span><br/></p></td><td><p><span><span>招生政策宣讲、专业学科解读</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>10:</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>0-12:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>导师与学生交流互动</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>注：具体活动以现场安排为准，请关注相关通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span> </span><span><span>参加研招校园开放日活动的学生必须遵守中国地质大学（武汉）相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>次开放日活动仅为招生宣传，与招生选拔工作无关。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院网址：</span></span><span>https://jidian.cug.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：湖北省武汉市鲁磨路</span><span>388号中国地质大学（武汉）西区机电学院，邮政编码：430074，    联系人：</span></span><span><span>徐</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>办公室：教二楼</span><span>501，           电话：027-67883</span></span><span><span>273</span></span><span><span>，</span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail：</span></span><span>xukaijd@cug.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）机电学院</span>      </span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"b5cf5e7c6614f93956dc33f82140c243d3af274b681c36a19ee7df7673e3b89b","textLength":1541,"sourceSha256":"eae19948075b98ffdb2d3c45a16605c5d2594f8dc0ad2feb404ef775990c9bd9","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a136e2bca5ec985c58f5","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）机械与电子信息学院2026年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:59.774941+00:00"}
